Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.73,0:00:01.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fetele...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.97,0:00:03.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}urmează să vină, una câte una,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}în această cameră,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.15,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}ca să se culce cu mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu, nu, nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.12,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inima mea îi aparține \Nnumai și numai lui Hime!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.57,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doar vom petrece niște timp în această cameră ca să ne apropiem
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.57,0:00:22.62,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}pentru a-l putea învinge pe Regele Abisului.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Așa că, pentru început... Știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.47,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Voi avea o discuție serioasă cu ele.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.31,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Amber? Când ai...?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.91,0:02:07.40,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Surprins?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.40,0:02:10.80,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Nici nu m-ai simțit când am venit.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.80,0:02:11.94,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Ești așa cu capul în nori.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.21,0:02:13.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,D-Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.66,0:02:15.59,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Tu ești prima, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.10,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.99,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Știu ce te frământă.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.02,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh, mă bucur să aud asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.58,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Da, ar trebui să ne gândim bine înainte să...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.58,0:02:29.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Nu ai de ce să-ți faci griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.61,0:02:33.78,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Am fost creată astfel \Nîncât să pot face sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.13,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Pot extrage fluide din organul tău genital
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.13,0:02:41.01,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,pe care să le folosesc apoi pentru a fertiliza ADN-ul piticilor păstrat în mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.26,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Asta îmi va permite să produc copii.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,C-Copii?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.75,0:02:48.23,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Da. Copiii ultimei prințese a piticilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.68,0:02:51.77,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,A-Asta e o mare responsabilitate.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.77,0:02:54.38,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Corpul meu arată astfel
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.38,0:02:58.54,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,ca să-i excite pe bărbații din rasa umană.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.29,0:03:03.48,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Rege al Inelelor, \Nvreau să-mi verifici corpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.21,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Ce părere ai?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.21,0:03:07.95,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Chiar are tot ce trebuie.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.06,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Și aici...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.06,0:03:12.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.25,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu știu prea multe \Ndespre acea zonă intimă!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.36,0:03:19.09,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Dar cred că ești frumoasă!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Excitarea Regelui Inelelor confirmată.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.55,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Păi, asta e...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.83,0:03:26.77,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,E de ajuns pentru moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.77,0:03:27.51,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.54,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Voiam doar să-mi verifici funcțiile.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.54,0:03:34.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Nu e necesar ca noi doi să facem sex.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.24,0:03:38.44,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Am fost creată în \Nîntregime pentru tine,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.85,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,așa că nu e nevoie să \Nne apropiem mai mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.38,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Legătura noastră era deja la \Nmaxim încă de la început.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.09,0:03:51.28,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Așa că poți face orice dorești cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.65,0:03:55.29,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Asta e dorința mea și destinul meu.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.29,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,În plus,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.29,0:04:02.60,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,e de ajuns doar să împarți puțin din sămânța ta cu mine după ce ai făcut sex cu prințesa Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.23,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Asta e de ajuns pentru ea?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.06,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Mult noroc, Rege al Inelelor.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.17,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,M-Mersi.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.36,0:04:21.32,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat, Regele al Inelelor Satou?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.07,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Asta e șansa ta să te culci cu mine, știi?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.77,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat? Haide, grăbește-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.70,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.70,0:04:32.29,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu nu simt vreo \Ndorință să fac asta cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Poftim?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.63,0:04:34.99,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Nu vă înțeleg deloc pe voi, oamenii!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.99,0:04:37.29,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Sunt o femeie extraordinar de frumoasă!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.34,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,E vreo diferență între ce găsesc \Natractiv rasele noastre?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.34,0:04:41.55,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stima ei de sine ajunge până la Lună.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.55,0:04:42.70,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Vai, vai, vai...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.70,0:04:48.46,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ba chiar eram pregătită să devin jucăria ta când ți-am devenit mireasă!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.46,0:04:50.10,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Da, sigur...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu, doar că, ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.38,0:04:55.64,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Arăți ca un copil pentru mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.81,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Un copil?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.81,0:04:57.95,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,De unde?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.45,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ce anume mă face să par un copil?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.45,0:05:04.40,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Sora mea mai mică și-o \Ntrage deja cu Marse, știi?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.40,0:05:07.57,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Până și modul cum vorbesc \Ne mai matur decât al ei!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.34,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Nu mai contează.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.34,0:05:12.96,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Nici eu nu eram interesată de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.16,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.57,0:05:19.08,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că îți este greu să te hotărăști când ai atâtea femei care te adoră.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.08,0:05:23.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Dar ar trebui să alegi \Nceea ce-ți spune inima.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.95,0:05:27.59,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Abia aștept să văd ce va ieși din asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.09,0:05:31.22,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Doar am fost mereu prințesa \Npură și inocentă din palat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Sunt multe chestii \Nenervante în afara palatului,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.88,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,dar mă distrez destul de bine acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.19,0:05:37.46,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Și...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.81,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,fii sincer și spune-mi când vei \Nîncepe să-mi dorești trupul.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.90,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu se va întâmpla.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.77,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ei bine, bănuiesc că e \Nmomentul ca eu să mă retrag
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.74,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,și să merg să le tachinez \Npe celelalte fete.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.28,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Să nu exagerezi, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.28,0:05:57.05,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Da, știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.59,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,A fost oribil...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.75,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Satou a fost atât de barbar...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.89,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,A făcut tot ce a vrut cu mine \Nchiar dacă eu i-am spus: „Nu!”
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.86,0:06:18.26,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Bun. E rândul lui Nefritis acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.80,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Cât de plictisitor.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.80,0:06:22.18,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Ești destul de perspicace, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.18,0:06:23.52,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Ce ușurare.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.34,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Te rog să nu-ți faci griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.34,0:06:32.98,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Nu aș merge niciodată mai \Ndeparte decât tine, Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.75,0:06:43.67,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.75,0:06:49.73,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Pot să vin puțin mai aproape?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.18,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh! Desigur!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.09,0:07:03.12,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Mi-ar plăcea să stau așa lângă tine pentru totdeauna, dacă e posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.82,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Înțeleg ceea ce simți, Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.37,0:07:10.90,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Chiar ții la Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.76,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Tu ești pe primul loc pentru mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.70,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Dar nu e la fel și pentru tine, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.37,0:07:22.09,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Mă îndoiesc că se va schimba \Nceva, oricât aș aștepta.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.51,0:07:26.61,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Dar tot doresc să mă iubești \Npuțin mai mult, dacă e posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.70,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,E greșit să doresc asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.21,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.98,0:07:38.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I-am spus lui Krystal să nu-și \Nfacă griji înainte să vin aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.08,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I-am promis că nu voi face nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.87,0:07:46.52,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Dar cred...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.01,0:07:50.19,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,că-mi voi încalca puțin promisiunea.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.13,0:08:25.38,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.38,0:08:28.23,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Satou nu a făcut nimc.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.76,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Î-Înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Bun! Eu urmez!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.45,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Mult noroc.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.17,0:08:47.35,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,{\i1}Se panichează, se panichează.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.09,0:08:57.05,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Pregătește-te, Rege al Inelelor Satou!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.19,0:09:00.57,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Să vedem cine va câștiga,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.57,0:09:04.02,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,farmecul meu de femeie \Nsau convingerea ta!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.42,0:09:07.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Stai! Asta e puțin prea brusc!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Renunță!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.73,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Crezi că mă poți învinge \Nîn ceea ce privește forța?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.73,0:09:14.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.53,0:09:20.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ce spui de asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ei bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.86,0:09:25.88,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.89,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Asta e o capcană a Stăbunei!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.62,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Chiar e nevoie să facem asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ai auzit și povestea \Nfostului Rege al Inelelor!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.97,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Nu-mi fac griji pentru asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.56,0:09:41.59,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Regele nostru actual nu ne va \Ndevora pentru a-și stinge poftele.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Pentru că...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.35,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,o iubești pe Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.25,0:09:52.41,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,De aceea nu vrei să faci \Nnimic care ar trăda-o pe Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.75,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Îți recunosc convingerea.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.46,0:09:57.72,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Dar atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.20,0:10:01.04,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,ce fac cu sentimentele mele?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Nu pot folosi magie,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.29,0:10:09.54,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,și nu te pot proteja complet \Ndoar cu sabia mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Așa că...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.96,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,chiar dacă doar pentru o clipă...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.68,0:10:17.64,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,lasă-mă să am o valoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Rege al Inelelor...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.82,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.14,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ești panicată?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.19,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Miau?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.48,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,N-Nu, nu sunt panicată sau ceva!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.48,0:10:38.20,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,De obicei ai fi spus direct\N că vrei să faci copii.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.69,0:10:42.30,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ce-i cu vorba asta despre valoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.30,0:10:45.61,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Deja mă bazez destul de mult pe tine, Granart,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.61,0:10:48.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,și ei bine, cred că ești destul de atrăgătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.00,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Chiar?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.00,0:10:55.21,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Chiar mă găsești atrăgătoare?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.34,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,D-Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.09,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,În cazul ăsta,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.09,0:11:04.16,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,ai putea arăta asta \Nun pic mai mult prin atitudinea ta, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.65,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Te iert de data asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.19,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.12,0:11:26.11,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,D-Destul!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.11,0:11:28.11,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Am înțeles! E destul!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.11,0:11:28.70,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.91,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce? Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.47,0:11:34.71,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,{\i1}A fost prima dată...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.24,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.71,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ești cu adevărat un adversar redutabil.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.71,0:11:44.49,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hă?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.86,0:11:48.10,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Vai, vai.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.18,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat cu tine?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.89,0:11:55.36,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Ei bine, ultima e Sora cea Mare.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.34,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Dar înainte de asta, trebuie să vorbim.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.57,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Așa că ai putea veni cu mine puțin?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.43,0:12:06.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am reușit...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.06,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am rezistat.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ultima e Hime!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.43,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.26,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Scuze că te-am făcut să aștepți.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.64,0:12:26.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.31,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.45,0:12:33.35,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Privește.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.19,0:12:36.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ce e asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.81,0:12:38.44,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}E erotic!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.23,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,E o vrajă... o inscripție.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.23,0:12:44.07,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Are un efect contraceptiv.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.21,0:12:47.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.68,0:12:52.66,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Soro Mare, am auzit că \Ncăutai o metodă de contracepție?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.18,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Ne-ai auzit?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.84,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Am auzit întâmplător.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.63,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,De fapt, am găsit una.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.04,0:13:04.34,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Cărțile Bătrânei din această cameră \Nconțineau o vrajă contraceptivă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.36,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Dacă ești dispusă să implori,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.26,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,aș putea s-o încerc pe tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.97,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,N-Nu prea—
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.11,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,O vrei? Sau nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.18,0:13:18.19,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,O vreau.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.19,0:13:20.19,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Soro obraznică!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.32,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.20,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,E bine, e bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.51,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Planificarea familială e importantă, până la urmă.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.56,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Vezi tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.56,0:13:31.67,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,asta e felul meu de a-mi sprijini \Nsora pierdută de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.08,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Cât timp vraja rămâne activă...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.66,0:13:39.51,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,nu va trebui să ne facem griji pentru copii.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.90,0:13:42.03,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.97,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,e ceva ce trebuie să facem...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.01,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,pentru a te ajuta să devii mai puternic...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.54,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Așadar, Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.27,0:13:57.48,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,hai să facem dragoste?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.19,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.05,0:14:05.40,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Acum, tot ce-mi pasă\N e să fiu cu tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.88,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Ș-Și eu simt la fel.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.17,0:14:11.69,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hei, Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.04,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Încearcă să mă atingi aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.85,0:14:19.54,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Se simte incredibil de... fierbinte.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.17,0:14:23.90,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,E asta... din cauza vrăjii?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.67,0:14:32.42,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm, deci femeia e o supusă desăvârșită...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.13,0:14:28.90,Dialogue,Both,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.68,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Așa se face în altă lume?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Vocea asta aparține... Bătrânei?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,De unde ne privește?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.18,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Din camera mea de observație.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.14,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Care ar fi rostul dacă n-aș putea privi?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.14,0:14:44.02,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Citește atmosfera!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Scuzați-mă.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.72,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Erați atât de inocenți \Nîncât n-am putut rămâne tăcută.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.68,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ei, nu vă sinchisiți.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.68,0:14:54.37,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Voi, tinerilor, apucați-vă de treabă.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.53,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Proasto!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.53,0:14:57.73,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Cum să fac asta știind că \Nsuntem priviți?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.29,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Starea jenantă a lui Hime e doar pentru mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.34,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ce bătaie de cap.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.13,0:15:10.50,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,C-Ce-i asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.14,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Bătrâno! Ce-ai făcut?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.71,0:15:16.85,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hei, Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.23,0:15:21.91,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Cred că... nu mai pot rezista.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.56,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pasă că suntem priviți.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.31,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.88,0:15:26.69,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu se poate?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ba da, cu siguranță!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}E gaz afrodisiac!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.03,0:15:38.13,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Hai, să facem copii!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.58,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Nu mai aștept!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.40,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Hai s-o facem!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.39,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Și tu, Saphir?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.39,0:15:44.47,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Dar Amber?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.70,0:15:47.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Desigur că ești în siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.00,0:15:52.88,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Stai, tu doar privești?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.24,0:15:57.18,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime! Așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.13,0:15:59.46,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu așa!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.65,0:16:02.84,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,B-Blestem...!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.44,0:16:04.64,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.69,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,E greșit!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.49,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Adevărat! Ce s-a întâmplat cu Morion?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.71,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,M-ai chemat, Frate Mare?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.04,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu e bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Și ea a fost afectată!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.25,0:16:32.93,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Ce bărbat obraznic...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.93,0:16:37.43,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Ar trebui să accepți \Ncând o femeie ți se oferă.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.52,0:16:50.48,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Oh, Frate Mare...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.99,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Amber! Oprește-le pe toate!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.99,0:16:58.32,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Să le opresc?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.84,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Pot face asta, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.84,0:17:01.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu-mi pasă cum, doar repede!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.71,0:17:03.91,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Atunci o să le lovesc până leșină.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.91,0:17:04.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Am greșit cerându-ți ajutorul!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.71,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmph. Bărbat încăpățânat.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.22,0:17:12.34,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu-mi place, dar te voi ajuta.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.94,0:17:16.36,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}Vom folosi puterea Inelului pentru a \Nle readuce femeile la simțiri.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.15,0:17:18.34,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Cum?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.73,0:17:21.47,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,Doar eliberează puterea cu voința ta.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.31,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,Lasă restul pe seama mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.72,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.15,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Vânt!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.56,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,A purificat ceața afrodisiacă?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Toată lumea, ascultați.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,A fi logodit...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.03,0:17:57.90,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,A te căsători...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.90,0:18:02.12,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,înseamnă a trăi împreună \Nca o familie fericită și intimă
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.12,0:18:05.24,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,într-o căsuță albă \Npe un deal cu un câine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Asta cred eu!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.46,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,A început să spună nebunii...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.65,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Bătrâno, nici tu nu trebuie să renunți!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.54,0:18:19.86,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,E adevărat că n-am putut \Nînvinge Regele Adâncurilor,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,dar asta nu înseamnă că \Nvom eșua din nou!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.23,0:18:24.46,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.46,0:18:27.79,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Nu, {\i1}noi{\i0} vom reuși cu siguranță!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.07,0:18:34.01,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Renunți? La el?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.63,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Ce crud!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.63,0:18:39.63,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Să-i iei viața și să-l arunci \Nca pe ceva folosit...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ce motiv ar fi să ezităm?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.13,0:18:46.94,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,De câte ori ne-a \Nviolat și devorat acel bărbat?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.27,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,E răzbunare justificată!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.44,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Nu cred asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.29,0:18:56.34,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Bărbatul acela a luptat mereu singur!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.34,0:18:59.85,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Noi ne-am mulțumit că eram dorite,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.85,0:19:02.82,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,dar niciodată n-am încercat să fim alături de el!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.24,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Renunț, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Poate că am renunțat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.78,0:19:17.78,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Și la mine, și la acel bărbat.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.59,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Ei bine, faceți ce vreți.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.07,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.07,0:19:26.93,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nu am de gând să deschid poarta Bibliotecii.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.48,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Încercați să o depășiți prin forța voastră.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.36,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Magie, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.65,0:19:48.97,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.97,0:19:52.19,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Nu sunt la fel de pricepută ca tata și mama,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,dar am vrut să învăț puțin câte puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.02,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ești atât de sârguincioasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.17,0:20:09.06,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Mama mea a fost o mare războinică.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.09,0:20:14.30,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Totuși, a fost învinsă de tatăl meu \Nîn ritualul de curtare al familiei regale.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.85,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Nu a mai ridicat niciodată sabia
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.85,0:20:19.72,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,și a trăit doar ca să mă crească.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.20,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Apoi, într-o zi...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.97,0:20:25.18,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Când eram mică,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.05,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,m-a părăsit și a dispărut.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.68,0:20:33.67,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Nu vreau să devin \No carcasă goală ca mama mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.35,0:20:36.06,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Granart-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.12,0:20:40.95,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Scuză povestea ciudată. Uit-o.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.86,0:20:46.20,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Am găsit o carte despre magia oamenilor-pisică.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.39,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Cum adică?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.46,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,N-am auzit niciodată ca vreun om-pisică \Nsă poată folosi magie...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.68,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Conform acestei cărți,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.68,0:20:57.90,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,mana oamenilor-pisică ia adesea \No formă diferită de cea a altor rase.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.48,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Asta o face greu de detectat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.26,0:21:02.53,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Acum că spui,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.53,0:21:07.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,am simțit o căldură ciudată \Ncând Satou m-a atins.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.63,0:21:09.99,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Dacă asta era senzația aceea, atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.98,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Sunt sigură că, la momentul potrivit,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.25,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,vei putea folosi și tu \Nmagia Inelului.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.49,0:21:22.60,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,E ciudat. Mi-e așa ușor \Nsă vorbesc cu tine, Nefritis.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.26,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ei bine, ar trebui să ne întoarcem curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,E timpul pentru cină.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.99,0:21:35.39,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Mă întreb ce vom mânca diseară.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.39,0:21:36.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Sunt nerăbdătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.51,0:21:40.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Am auzit că Krystal se dă peste cap \Nsă gătească în seara asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Granart-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.80,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Știu că ai spus să uit,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.80,0:21:51.74,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,dar voi păstra ce mi-ai împărtășit \Nîn adâncul inimii mele.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.27,0:21:56.29,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Așa că te rog să-ți amintești că știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.65,0:21:59.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ce lucru ciudat de spus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:02.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.63,0:22:08.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.63,0:22:11.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:00.73,0:00:01.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}All of them...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.97,0:00:03.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}are about to come one by one
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}into this room,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.19,0:00:09.15,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}to sleep with me!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:13.05,0:00:14.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.91,0:00:18.12,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've set my heart on Hime and only her!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.57,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're just spending time in \Nthis room to deepen our bonds
Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.57,0:00:22.62,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}so we can defeat the Abyss King.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,So for now... I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.47,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I'll have a proper talk with them.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.31,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Amber? When did you...?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.91,0:02:07.40,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.40,0:02:10.80,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,You didn't even notice my approach.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.80,0:02:11.94,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,So careless.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.21,0:02:13.66,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.66,0:02:15.59,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You were up first, weren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:18.81,0:02:20.10,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.99,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I know what you're concerned about.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.02,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.58,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Yeah, we should think this through...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.58,0:02:29.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.61,0:02:33.78,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I was designed to be capable of intercourse.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.13,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I can extract fluids from your manhood
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.13,0:02:41.01,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,and use it to fertilize the dwarven DNA\N preserved inside me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.26,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,That will allow me to produce children.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.26,0:02:44.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Ch-Children?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.75,0:02:48.23,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Yes. Children of the dwarves' final princess.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:48.68,0:02:51.77,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Th-That's a grave responsibility.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:51.77,0:02:54.38,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,This is why my body was given a shape
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.38,0:02:58.54,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,that should prove arousing to human men.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.29,0:03:03.48,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Ring King, I want you to check.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.21,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:06.21,0:03:07.95,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.95,0:03:09.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}She does have everything.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.17,0:03:12.06,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,And here...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.06,0:03:12.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.85,0:03:15.25,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I don't know about such an intimate part!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.36,0:03:19.09,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,But I do think you're pretty!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Arousal of the Ring King confirmed.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.61,0:03:24.55,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Look, this is—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.83,0:03:26.77,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,That concludes this for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.77,0:03:27.51,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.54,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I simply wanted to confirm my functions.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.54,0:03:34.61,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,It's not necessary for you to \Nengage in sex with me anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.24,0:03:38.44,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I was created entirely for you,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.85,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,so there's no need to deepen our bonds further.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.38,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,They were already maxed from the start.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:47.09,0:03:51.28,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,So you can do whatever you wish with me.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.65,0:03:55.29,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,That's all I desire, and that's my destiny.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.29,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:57.29,0:04:02.60,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,you may simply share a bit of your seed \Nafter having sex with Princess Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.23,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's good enough for her?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.06,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Good luck, Ring King.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.17,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.36,0:04:21.32,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Ring King Satou?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.32,0:04:25.07,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,This is your chance to\N get it on with me, you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.07,0:04:27.77,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.77,0:04:28.70,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.70,0:04:32.29,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I just don't seem to have the urge\N to do that with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.29,0:04:33.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.63,0:04:34.99,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I don't get you humans!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.99,0:04:37.29,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I'm an exceptionally beautiful woman!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:37.29,0:04:39.34,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Is there a difference in \Nwhat our races find attractive?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.34,0:04:41.55,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}She has high self-esteem.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:41.55,0:04:42.70,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Boo hoo hoo...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.70,0:04:48.46,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I was even prepared to become your \Nplaything when I became your bride!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.46,0:04:50.10,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was that really true?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.61,0:04:53.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,No, it's just, well...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:53.38,0:04:55.64,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You look too childish to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.81,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Childish?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.81,0:04:57.95,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.45,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,What part of me is childish?!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:00.45,0:05:04.40,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,My little sister is already \Ngetting it on with Marse, you know!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.40,0:05:07.57,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Even the way I talk is \Nmore mature than her!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.89,0:05:09.34,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:09.34,0:05:12.96,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I was never interested in you either.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.16,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.57,0:05:19.08,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,It must be hard to make up your mind \Nwhen so many woman adore you.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.08,0:05:23.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,However, you should make the decision \Nthat's true to your desires.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.95,0:05:27.59,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I plan to enjoy watching what comes from that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.09,0:05:31.22,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I was always the pure, innocent princess \Nin the palace, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.22,0:05:33.63,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,There are many annoyances outside the palace,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.88,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,but I'm having a fair deal of fun right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.19,0:05:37.46,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:37.81,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,do be honest and say something \Nwhen you start longing for my body.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.90,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.87,0:05:49.77,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I'll take my leave now
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.74,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,and go tease the other girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.28,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Just don't go too far, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.28,0:05:57.05,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.59,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,How cruel...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.59,0:06:06.75,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Satou was so cruel...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.75,0:06:09.89,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Exacting his lusts upon me as I protested!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.86,0:06:18.26,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Right. Next up is Nefritis-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.80,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,How boring.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.80,0:06:22.18,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,You're quite the shrewd one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.18,0:06:23.52,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.34,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Please don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.34,0:06:32.98,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I would never go further \Nthan you, Krystal-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.75,0:06:43.67,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.75,0:06:49.73,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Would you please let me sit \Na little closer for a bit?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.18,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Oh! Sure!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.09,0:07:03.12,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'd love to stay beside you like this \Nforever if it were possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.82,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, Satou-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.37,0:07:10.90,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,You truly cherish Krystal-sama.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.76,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,You're number one to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.70,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,But it's not the same for you, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.37,0:07:22.09,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I doubt that will change, \Nno matter how long I wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:22.51,0:07:26.61,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Yet I still long for you to love me \Na little more if you can.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.70,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Is it wrong to feel that way?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.37,0:07:33.21,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.98,0:07:38.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I told Krystal-sama not to worry \Nbefore I came in here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:39.48,0:07:42.08,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I promised her I wouldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:43.87,0:07:46.52,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,But I think...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.01,0:07:50.19,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm going to break my promise a little bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.13,0:08:25.38,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.38,0:08:28.23,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Satou-sama didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.76,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,All right! I'm next!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.45,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:45.17,0:08:47.35,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's panicking, she's panicking.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.09,0:08:57.05,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Time to brace yourself, Ring King Satou!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.19,0:09:00.57,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Let's see which will win,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.57,0:09:04.02,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,my attractiveness as a woman \Nor your conviction!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.42,0:09:07.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hold on! This is too sudden!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Give it up!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.73,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You think you can beat me in strength?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.73,0:09:14.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.53,0:09:20.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.29,0:09:21.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:24.86,0:09:25.88,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.89,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,This is the Elder's trap!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:27.89,0:09:30.62,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Is there really any need for us to do this?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You heard the story of the past Ring King too!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.97,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I'm not worried about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:35.56,0:09:41.59,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Our current Ring King won't \Ndevour us to slake his lusts.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.35,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,you love Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.25,0:09:52.41,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,That's why you really don't want to do \Nanything that would betray Krystal.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:52.41,0:09:54.75,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I recognize your conviction.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.46,0:09:57.72,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.20,0:10:01.04,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,what am I supposed to do with how I feel?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:03.74,0:10:05.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I can't use magic,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:06.29,0:10:09.54,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,and I can't fully protect you \Nwith my sword alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.29,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.96,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,even if it's just for a moment...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:14.68,0:10:17.64,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,let me have some value.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.08,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Ring King...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.82,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.55,0:10:28.14,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Are you panicking?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.19,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Meow?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.19,0:10:31.48,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I-I'm not panicking or anything!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.48,0:10:38.20,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Uh, you would usually straight-up say\N you wanted to make babies.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.69,0:10:42.30,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,What's all this about value?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.30,0:10:45.61,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I already rely on you a good deal, Granart,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.61,0:10:48.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,and well, I think you're plenty attractive.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.00,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.00,0:10:55.21,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You actually do find me attractive?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.34,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.09,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.09,0:11:04.16,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,you could show it a bit more \Nwith your attitude, couldn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.65,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I'll let you off with that this time.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:08.99,0:11:10.19,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.12,0:11:26.11,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,E-Enough!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.11,0:11:28.11,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Got it! That's enough!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.11,0:11:28.70,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.91,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? What?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:31.47,0:11:34.71,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was a first...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.52,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.99,0:11:40.24,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.71,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You really are a formidable foe.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.71,0:11:44.49,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.86,0:11:48.10,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.18,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.89,0:11:55.36,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Well then, last is Big Sis.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.34,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Though before that, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.57,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,So could you come with me for a bit?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.43,0:12:06.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I did it...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.81,0:12:09.06,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}I managed to endure.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.41,0:12:11.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Last up is Hime!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.43,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.26,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.64,0:12:26.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.07,0:12:31.31,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.45,0:12:33.35,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.19,0:12:36.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is that?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.81,0:12:38.44,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's erotic!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.23,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,It's a spell... inscription.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:41.23,0:12:44.07,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,It has a contraceptive effect.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.21,0:12:47.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It what?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.68,0:12:52.66,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Big Sis, I heard you were looking for \Na means of contraception?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.18,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,You heard us?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.84,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,I overheard.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.84,0:12:58.63,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Actually, I found one.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:59.04,0:13:04.34,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,The Elder's books in this room \Ncontained a contraception spell.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.36,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,If you're willing to beg for it,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.26,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,I could try it out on you.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.26,0:13:12.97,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I-I don't really—
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.11,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Do you want it? Or not?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.18,0:13:18.19,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I want it.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.19,0:13:20.19,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Naughty sister!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.32,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.32,0:13:23.20,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.51,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Family planning is important, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:26.22,0:13:27.56,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You see...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.56,0:13:31.67,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,this is my way of supporting \Nmy long-lost sister.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.54,0:13:36.08,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,While this spell remains in effect...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.66,0:13:39.51,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,we won't have to worry about making a baby.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.90,0:13:42.03,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.97,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,is something we need to do...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.01,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,to help you grow stronger...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.54,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,So, Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.27,0:13:57.48,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,let's have sex?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.19,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:02.05,0:14:05.40,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Right now, all I care about\N is having sex with you!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.88,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I-I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:10.17,0:14:11.69,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hey, Satou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.04,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Try touching me here.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.85,0:14:19.54,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,It feels incredibly... hot.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.17,0:14:23.90,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Is this... because of the spell?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.67,0:14:32.42,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmm, so the woman is a thorough power bottom...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.13,0:14:28.90,Dialogue,Both,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.42,0:14:34.68,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is how they do it in another world?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.68,0:14:36.75,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,That voice belongs to... the Elder?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.81,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Where is she watching from?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.18,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,From my observation room.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.14,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,What would be the point if I couldn't watch?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.14,0:14:44.02,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Read the room!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.10,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.72,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You two were being so innocent, \NI couldn't stay quiet.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.68,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Well, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.68,0:14:54.37,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,You whippersnappers should just get to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.53,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.53,0:14:57.73,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,How could I do it when I know \Nwe're being watched?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.29,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime's embarrassing state is for me alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.34,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.13,0:15:10.50,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.14,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Elder! What have you done?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.71,0:15:16.85,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Hey, Satou...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.23,0:15:21.91,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I don't think... I can take it anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.56,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,I don't care if we're being watched.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:24.56,0:15:25.31,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.88,0:15:26.69,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,It can't be?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It definitely is!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's aphrodisiac gas!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.92,0:15:36.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Granart?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.03,0:15:38.13,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Come on, let's make babies!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.58,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I won't wait anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.12,0:15:42.40,Dialogue,Saphir,0,0,0,,Why don't we do it?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.41,0:15:43.39,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,You too, Saphir?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.39,0:15:44.47,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,What about Amber?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.70,0:15:47.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Of course you're safe.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:51.00,0:15:52.88,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wait, you're just watching?!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.64,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,Satou!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.24,0:15:57.18,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Hime! Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.13,0:15:59.46,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Not like this!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.65,0:16:02.84,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,D-Damn it...!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.44,0:16:04.64,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.69,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,This is wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.49,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Right! What happened to Morion?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.24,0:16:24.71,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You called, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.04,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's been caught in it too!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.25,0:16:32.93,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,What a naughty man...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.93,0:16:37.43,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,You should accept it when \Na woman offers herself to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:47.52,0:16:50.48,Dialogue,Morion,0,0,0,,Oh, Big Brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.45,0:16:56.99,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Amber! Please stop everyone!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.99,0:16:58.32,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Stop them?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.84,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,I can do that, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:59.84,0:17:01.71,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I don't care how, just hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:01.71,0:17:03.91,Dialogue,Amber,0,0,0,,Then I'll punch each one unconscious.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.91,0:17:04.85,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:04.85,0:17:06.33,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I was wrong to ask for your help!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.71,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmph. Stubborn man.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.22,0:17:12.34,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't like it, but I'll lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.94,0:17:16.36,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll use the power of the Ring to \Nrestore those women to their senses.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.15,0:17:18.34,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.73,0:17:21.47,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,You just unleash the power with your will.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.31,Dialogue,Ring,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.72,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.15,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wind!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.56,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,He purified the aphrodisiac mist?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.00,0:17:52.38,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen up.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.03,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,To be wed...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.03,0:17:57.90,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,To get married...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.90,0:18:02.12,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,means living together \Nas a happy, intimate family
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.12,0:18:05.24,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,in a little white house \Non a hill with a pet dog.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.98,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,That's what I believe!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.84,0:18:11.46,Dialogue,Hime,0,0,0,,He's started spouted something crazy...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.94,0:18:14.65,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Elder, you shouldn't give up either!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.54,0:18:19.86,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,It's true that we couldn't \Ndefeat the Abyss King,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.91,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean we're \Nguaranteed to fail again!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:23.23,0:18:24.46,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.46,0:18:27.79,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}we{\i0} will surely overcome this!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.07,0:18:34.01,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Are you giving up? On him?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.53,0:18:36.63,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,That's so cruel!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.63,0:18:39.63,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,Taking his life and casting him away \Nlike he's served his purpose...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.92,0:18:42.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,What reason is there to hesitate?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.13,0:18:46.94,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,How many times has that man \Nviolated and devoured us?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.27,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,This is justified revenge!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.44,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,I don't believe so!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.29,0:18:56.34,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,That man always fought alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:56.34,0:18:59.85,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,We contented ourselves with being desired,
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.85,0:19:02.82,Dialogue,LightPrincess,0,0,0,,and we never strived to stand alongside him!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.24,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Give up, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.13,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Perhaps I had given up.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.78,0:19:17.78,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,On both myself, and on that man.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.34,0:19:22.59,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,Well, you all can do whatever you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.91,0:19:24.07,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.07,0:19:26.93,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't plan on opening the Library door.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.48,Dialogue,Peridot,0,0,0,,{\i1}Try overcoming it with your own strength.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.48,Dialogue,Satou,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.36,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Magic, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.65,0:19:48.97,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:48.97,0:19:52.19,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm not as skilled at it as Father and Mother,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.96,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,but I wanted to learn more bit by bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.02,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,You're so diligent.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:05.17,0:20:09.06,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,My mother was a great warrior.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.09,0:20:14.30,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Despite that, she was defeated by my father \Nin the royal family's traditional courting.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.85,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,She never took up the sword again
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.85,0:20:19.72,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,and lived solely to raise me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.86,0:20:22.20,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Then one day...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.97,0:20:25.18,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,When I was still little,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.05,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,she abandoned me and disappeared.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.68,0:20:33.67,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I don't want to become \Nan empty shell like my mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:34.35,0:20:36.06,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Granart-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:37.12,0:20:40.95,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Sorry for the weird story. Forget about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.86,0:20:46.20,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I found a book on cat people magic.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:46.20,0:20:47.39,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.46,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any cat people \Nbeing able to use magic...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.14,0:20:52.68,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,According to this book,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:52.68,0:20:57.90,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,the mana of cat people often takes \Na different shape than with other races.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.48,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,That's what makes it hard to detect.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:01.26,0:21:02.53,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.53,0:21:07.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I felt an unfamiliar heat \Nwhen Satou touched me.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.63,0:21:09.99,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,If that's what that feeling was, then...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.25,0:21:12.98,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm sure that, given the right opportunity,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.25,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,you'll be able to use \Nthe Ring's magic as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.49,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.49,0:21:22.60,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,It's strange. I find it so easy \Nto talk around you, Nefritis.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.26,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,Well, we should start heading back soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,It's time for dinner.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.99,0:21:35.39,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I wonder what we're having tonight.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.39,0:21:36.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.51,0:21:40.98,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,I heard Krystal was going \Nall-out to make it tonight.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.33,0:21:42.86,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,Granart-sama...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.80,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,I know you said to forget about it,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.80,0:21:51.74,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,but I'll keep what you shared with me \Ntucked away in my heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.27,0:21:56.29,Dialogue,Nefritis,0,0,0,,So please remember that I know about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.65,0:21:59.63,Dialogue,Granart,0,0,0,,What an odd thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
